```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Jira as Jira Board
    participant Auto as Jira Automation
    participant WoW as WoW Rules (planning trigger)
    participant Item as Work Item

    Dev->>Jira: Move issue to "Selected for Development"
    Jira->>Auto: Status transition event

    Auto->>WoW: Load rules with applies_to: [planning]
    WoW-->>Auto: DoD checklist, architecture principles, etc.

    Auto->>Item: Add comment with planning checklist
    Note over Item: 📋 "Before starting, review these team agreements:"

    alt Workflow validator enabled
        Dev->>Jira: Attempt to move to "In Progress"
        Jira->>Jira: Check: "DoD Reviewed" field = Yes?
        alt Field not checked
            Jira-->>Dev: ❌ Blocked — review DoD first
        else Field checked
            Jira-->>Dev: ✅ Transition allowed
        end
    end
```
